cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: opendrop_ml
abstract: >-
  An open-source, cross-platform tool for contact angle and pendant drop
  analysis that combines classical drop-shape fitting with the Conan-MLII
  machine learning model for contact angle measurement.
version: 1.0.0
license: GPL-3.0-only
repository-code: "https://github.com/DanielGShaw/opendrop_ml"
keywords:
  - contact angle
  - goniometry
  - pendant drop
  - interfacial tension
  - machine learning
